full_article:
An Indian tourist was killed and a New Zealander injured after two helicopters collided while preparing to land in Nepal's Mount Everest region on Tuesday, authorities said.

The New Zealander was rescued, Kaman Singh Thapa Magar, chief district officer of Solukhumbu district, told Reuters.

The accident took place in the base camp area of Mount Everest, he said.

